0..49 Comment "// This source tests string namespace operations."
50..52 Comment "//"
53..124 Comment "// The native `string` namespace has `append`, `eq` and `lt`. It has no"
125..202 Comment "// containment, prefix, suffix, escaping or splitting operation. Scanning and"
203..246 Comment "// escaping remain planned text primitives."
247..249 Comment "//"
250..325 Comment "// String equality uses `==` through the prelude\'s `Eq` model. String order"
326..352 Comment "// uses `<` through `Ord`."
353..355 Comment "//"
356..370 Comment "// - see: #318"
371..386 Comment "// - see: #1832"
387..402 Comment "// - see: #2572"
